'''Le'Grim Strikes''' (ジャイアント黒蔵強襲, ''Jaianto Kurozō Kyōshū'', '''Giant Kurozō's Assault''') was an event added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Le'Grim Strikes would reset when the event ended, allowing the player to collect the rewards again once the event returned. The boss of this Gauntlet was [[Le'Grim]], an increasingly powerful variant of [[Le'noir]] with even longer range. As of [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]], this event was replaced with the [[Le'Grim Strikes|new version]] with 20 levels.

==Overview==
===About===
Le'Grim Strikes contained a total of 60 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Rampage Lvs''', spread across 3 different maps: '''Le'Grim Strikes!''' (Rampage Lv1~20), '''Le'Grim Strikes!!''' (Rampage Lv21~40) and '''Le'Grim Strikes!!!''' (Rampage Lv1~60). After beating a Rampage Lv, the player had to wait for 30 minutes before they could proceed to the next one. Rewards for the first completion of a Rampage Lv could include [[Battle Items]], [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Gamatoto Expedition|Catamins]], [[Ototo Corps|Materials]] and [[Cat Energy|Leaderships]]. Every 20 Rampage Lvs played out the same, but the strength magnifications and enemy base's HP were increased with each level.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Le'Grim Strikes (Old)/Rampage Lv1~20]], [[Le'Grim Strikes (Old)/Rampage Lv21~40]] and [[Le'Grim Strikes (Old)/Rampage Lv41~60]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Le'Grim Strikes! was unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1.
*Le'Grim Strikes!! was unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1 and appeared 2 days into the event.
*Le'Grim Strikes!!! was unlocked after clearing [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 1 and appeared 4 days into the event.

